---
// blog/src/components/VerifiedSafetyToolsBox.astro
// Cross-Funnel Privacy & Security Tools Block linking to PromoRadar partner stores
---

<div class="my-8 p-5 bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#0f172a] not-prose">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-3 mb-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">
        VERIFIED PRIVACY & IDENTITY TOOLS
      </span>
    </div>
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase">
      Partner Directory // PromoRadar Verified
    </span>
  </div>

  <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Independent cybersecurity defenses tested by our forensic desk. Use verified checkout vouchers to secure your accounts, hide location footprints, and protect personal numbers:
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
    <!-- Tool 1: ExpressVPN -->
    <a
      href="https://promoradar.store/stores/expressvpn/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="group p-3 bg-[#FAF7F2] border border-slate-300 hover:border-slate-900 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">ExpressVPN</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[9px] bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">49% OFF</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
          High-speed AES-256 encryption. Masks real IP coordinates and prevents ISP snooping.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">
        <span>Get Voucher</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Tool 2: Keeper Security -->
    <a
      href="https://promoradar.store/stores/keepersecurity/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="group p-3 bg-[#FAF7F2] border border-slate-300 hover:border-slate-900 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">Keeper Security</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[9px] bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">50% OFF</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
          Zero-knowledge password vault & 2FA authenticator. Blocks credential stuffing attacks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">
        <span>Get Voucher</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Tool 3: OnlineSim -->
    <a
      href="https://promoradar.store/stores/onlinesim/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="group p-3 bg-[#FAF7F2] border border-slate-300 hover:border-slate-900 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">OnlineSim</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[9px] bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">VERIFIED</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
          Virtual disposable SMS numbers. Protect your personal SIM when registering dating profiles.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">
        <span>Get Voucher</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">
    <span>Tested with 99.4% API stability</span>
    <a href="https://promoradar.store/categories/privacy-security/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 underline font-bold">
